# ==============================================================================
# Yommy Environment Variables Template (.env.example)
#
# Copy this file to .env.local for local development.
# In Git Worktrees, the package.json prepare script automatically copies .env.local
# from the main worktree (/workspaces/Yommy/.env.local) if present.
#
# Note: Tests (Vitest, Storybook VRT, Playwright IT) and production builds are
# designed to pass 100% deterministically without .env.local using mock DI adapters.
# ==============================================================================

# Google OAuth 2.0 Web Client ID (for Google Identity Services AuthorizationClient)
# In CI, this is injected via GitHub Secrets: VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID
# In local development, set your test Web Client ID from Google Cloud Console.
# If omitted or empty, cloud sync UI operates with mock bridge or disabled fallback.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=""
